  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>作物成熟標記器</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">在所有達到最大生長階段的作物上方添加小型標記！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組支援 Forge、Fabric 及 Neoforge（自 1.20.4 版起）。請查看檔案頁面以取得所有版本。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric 版本需搭配 Fabric API </span> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">由此取得</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gD7GDSB/Full-Grown-Crop-Marker.png\" alt=\"作物成熟標記器\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1000\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組僅需在客戶端安裝，無需在伺服器端安裝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:18px\">若對模組有任何疑問，或想了解即將推出的功能：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎加入我的 &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"> </a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a> </span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
